<title>FRANCE: One flour ship expected in Rouen by September 26.</title>
<headline>One flour ship expected in Rouen by September 26.</headline>
<dateline>PARIS 1996-09-24</dateline>
<text>
<p>One ship was expected in the French port of Rouen by September 26 to load around 7,000 tonnes of flour, port officials said on Tuesday.</p>
<p>Destination was not specified.</p>
<p>In Rouen, one ship was currently loading 400 tonnes of flour destined for West Africa, they said.</p>
<p>-- Paris newsroom +33 1 4221 5432</p>
